	(descr "Single-point bond of the low-voltage ground (GND) to the earthed oven chassis (PE), Rev3.0 stage 5 (2026-11-23). Plated hole 3.2 mm for an M3 screw, copper pad 7.0 mm on all copper layers, solder mask open dia 7.1 on the front (lug seat) and dia 5.6 on the back (screw-head seat; keeps 1.0 mm to the frame support ribs), solid zone connection (surge / ESD current, no thermal spokes). Lug side = F (component side): M3 ring lug directly on the pad, DIN 125 washer, locking means, M3 nut; screw head on B (ISO 7045 M3 pan head dk <= 5.6, height <= 2.4, no washer on B). Ring-lug lead to the chassis stud FH9. Board copper: not a BOM item, not in position files.")
